</byline><milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/><lb/>
<epigraph><cit><quote><hi rendition="#aq">Homo &#x017F;um, humani nihil a me alienum e&#x017F;&#x017F;e puto.<lb/>
</hi></quote><bibl><hi rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#i #aq">Terent.</hi></hi></bibl></cit></epigraph><lb/>
